          <msContents>
            <summary>The Ordinall of Alchymie: in verse. Written in a neat Secretary hand. Text within red rules. Second prelim leaf: Liber iste Clericis monstrat Scientiam. Second prelim verso: Grata superuenient qua non sperabitur hora. // Finis. P. 1 Norton Vpon // Alchymie. // [Two line inscription, struck through] // To the honour of god one, in persons three / this Booke is made that Lay-men should it see / ... 157 In the Yeare of Christe. mcccclxxvii. This Woork was begoon: honour to god in heaven. Soli Deo Honor / et gloria.</summary>
